description=Audit trail of animals (cards #192, #299). The server records what happens to each animal - claim, release, death with its cause, pregnancy, birth, growth, critical hunger or thirst, leaving or entering a pen - so staff and owners can read it in game. Standalone: animals nobody owns are followed inside pens with no other mod; claimed animals are audited when a claim system talks to it through GENZ_LivestockAudit.record and registerSource. Changes nothing on its own.
